  and are deliberately out of scope:\n  - CHANGELOG.md — release history, immutable by convention.\n  - pyproject.toml:445 — the comment \"(ticket f1eb, port of probe-rebar.sh)\" is an\n    accurate statement about where probe_rebar.py came from; rewriting it would\n    erase provenance, not fix a reference.\n  - docs/experiments/plan-review-gate/runs/operator_attested_ac_corpus.jsonl:97 —\n    a FROZEN experiment corpus record of a past ticket's AC text; editing it would\n    corrupt the dataset.\n  - scripts/probe_rebar.py:2 — its own docstring says \"port of probe-rebar.sh\";\n    same provenance rationale as the pyproject comment, left as-is.\n- [ ] gerrit-verify golden-path job green on the deleting change itself\n  (proves main's definition no longer needs the shim)\n\n## File impact\n- scripts/probe-rebar.sh (delete)","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"scripts/probe-rebar.sh","reason":"delete the transitional exec shim; all consumers now invoke scripts/probe_rebar.py directly"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"780f97d5-0e5a-4c5c-abf1-49bff5ac5188","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d772-6007-5d04-4101","ticket_type":"task","title":"Delete transitional probe-rebar.sh shim","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["76d6199a-01ac-4eee-9879-50412b5cd30e","0aae400b-237d-49cd-aa77-6440c70514c5","d401401e-60a0-4ec2-9a7d-367a34903a03","3a15ffbf-7abb-4e28-b442-5f02f6f45569","7c53ab14-5738-4b4e-911f-48b0e9f61898","c0c09add-681c-454d-9a09-ed8bfbd726fb","780f97d5-0e5a-4c5c-abf1-49bff5ac5188","e498909f-83cd-4ae2-a952-0e0d593ae9f7"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785892574880778002,"uuid":"78d5e48c-679c-41be-91b4